      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mu tshikondo tshidi bakelenge baluhuka bua kuluanganabo, Yoaba wakaya ne masalayi andi, wakahaula buloba bua Bena Amona, wakatshintshimika musoko wa Laba. Kadi Davidi wakashala mu Yelushalema. Yoaba wakahita Laba bukole, wakahaula musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakangata tshifulu tshia butumbi ku mutu kua mukelenge wabo, walu dikisha bujitu buatshi bu ntalanta",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.2:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ntalanta wa or wakadi ne bujitu bua 59 kg.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa or, tshiakadi tshilengeshibue ne mabue a mushinga mukole; bakatshiteka ha mutu ha Davidi; bakalua ne bintu bia bungi biakanyengabo mu musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakahatuka ne bantu bakadimu, wakabatuma ku mudimu ne scies ne nkasu ya biamu ne bisui. Davidi wakenzela ba mu misoko yonso ya Bena Amona nunku. Davidi ne bantu bandi bonso bakahingana ku Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua malu â Bena Peleshete ba mu Gezê bakabanga kuluangana; hashishe Sibekai, Muena Husha, wakashiha Sipai, umue wa bana balume ba nfiondo; bobo bakateketa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Peleshete bakaluangana kabidi; Elehanana, muana wa Yaî, wakashiha Lami, muanʼabo ne Goleyata, Muena Gata; mulabi wa difuma diandi wakadi bu mutshi udibo bakuma nʼau bilulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nvita yakadi mu Gata kabidi, kuakadi muntu munene wakadi ne minu ne bana ba makasa makumi abidi ne binai, minu isambombo ku tshianza ne ku tshianza, ne bana ba makasa basambombo ku dikasa ne ku dikasa; wakaledibua kudi muntu wa nfiondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafuneye bulobo kudi Bena Isalele, Yonatana, muana wa Shimea, muanʼabo ne Davidi, wakamushiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakadi baledibue kudi muntu wa nfiondo wa mu Gata; bakashihibua ku tshianza tshia Davidi ne ku bianza bia bantu bandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
